            "body": "> Disabling the plugin: Using vim.g.loaded_nvim_dir_plugin\n\nIgnore this for now. Let's focus on \"how do 3P plugins take over dir-buf handling\".\n\n> Dynamically enabling/disabling the plugin\n\nNot important. See above.\n\n> a new future-proof way to dynamically disable nvim plugins\n\nWe don't need to solve this right now.",
